# ============================================================
# Gothwad Tech — Cloudflare Pages redirects & SEO canonical
# Primary domain is https://gothwadtech.com (non-www).
# We 301 redirect www → apex for canonical consistency (fixes Google
# showing www.gothwadtech.com instead of gothwadtech.com).
# Order matters: specific redirects first, SPA fallback last.
# ============================================================

# 1) Enforce HTTPS + non-www canonical (SEO: stops www duplicate index)
https://www.gothwadtech.com/* https://gothwadtech.com/:splat 301!
http://www.gothwadtech.com/* https://gothwadtech.com/:splat 301!
http://gothwadtech.com/* https://gothwadtech.com/:splat 301!

# 2) Legacy path aliases (keep old links alive, pass link equity)
#    These used to be hash links — now they are real paths.
/about      /company  301!
/portfolio  /ecosystem 301!
/browser    /products 301!
/leadership /company 301!
/legacy     /ecosystem 301!

# 3) www subdomain direct (fallback if protocol not matched above)
www.gothwadtech.com/* https://gothwadtech.com/:splat 301!

# 4) SPA fallback — every unmatched path serves index.html so deep links
#    and hard-refresh on /ecosystem, /products etc. never 404.
#    Cloudflare Pages serves real assets first, so /favicon.ico,
#    /assets/*, /manifest.json etc. bypass this rule.
/*    /index.html   200
